# Quantified inner De Morgan construction; not a claim of optimization benefit.
Any<p0 a0>(Input<t0>,Filter<Or(p1,p2) a1 a4>(Input<t1>))|Any<p3 a3>(Input<t2>,Filter<Not(And(Not(p4),Not(p5))) a6 a5>(Input<t3>))|t2 := t0;t3 := t1;p3 := p0;a3 := a0;p4 := p1;p5 := p2;a6 := a1;a5 := a4
All<p0 a0>(Input<t0>,Filter<Or(p1,p2) a1 a4>(Input<t1>))|All<p3 a3>(Input<t2>,Filter<Not(And(Not(p4),Not(p5))) a6 a5>(Input<t3>))|t2 := t0;t3 := t1;p3 := p0;a3 := a0;p4 := p1;p5 := p2;a6 := a1;a5 := a4
